    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973170/extras/dee07809ca1387c1ee694d44978938b6.webp?t=1749366061\" width=470 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly being trapped in the world of gal game, the main character, CHUNI has come up with a good way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If I ignore all the heroine characters in this game and focus only on my childhood friend (boy) MAYUMU, I should be able to return to my original world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will CHUNI, a boy with a crazy idea who has no interest in any of the heroin characters in the gal game, be able to safely return to his original world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973170/extras/fed4b12c643803db18d7160495e53e86.webp?t=1749366061\" width=470 height=46 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre\uff1aVisual novel</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Voice\uff1aPart Voice\uff08Japanese voice only\uff09</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can fully immerse yourself in the decadent and pop-inspired world.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We plan to include the highly original theme song by OUROBOROS in the game.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can experience the despair of being surrounded by cute female characters but only being able to be in a relationship with a boy.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world devoid of ethics and conversation with venomous humor.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing in particular. Everything is for CHUNI.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973170/extras/159c912e62e7b391a3958685afacfeec.webp?t=1749366061\" width=470 height=46 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN CHARACTER: MALE CHARACTER WHO IS THE ONLY TARGET TO BE IN A RELATIONSHIP.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973170/extras/4dfcd84d609ebb65ee3ff0724b84e5ff.avif?t=1749366061\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHUNI / \u30c1\u30e5\u30a6\u30cb</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main character. A man with a wild idea. A laid-back personality and loved by everyone. </strong>Born on April 1. 170cm. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAYUMU / \u30de\u30e6\u30e0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He is CHUNI's only target, a man who is her childhood friend and best friend.</strong>He is a geek for erotic video games with cute girls. Born on June 10. 165 cm. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUB-CHARACTERS: CUTE AND UNIQUE GIRLS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973170/extras/5d97f4b51e2adf31abe0595ec6d6f09f.avif?t=1749366061\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*HOWEVER, CHUNI IS NOT INTERESTED IN GETTING A GIRLFRIEND, SO YOU CANNOT BE IN A RELATIONSHIP WITH THEM.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/